          <div type="letter">




<pb facs="3529610" n="167r"/>
<opener><salute rend="center"><lb/>Illustrissime, ac Celeberrime Domine!</salute></opener>
<p><lb/>Utor oportuna Illustrissimi Comitis de <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118608576">Schmettau</rs> occasione,
<lb/>qui me, <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2761369">Vienn<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> versans, invisere dignatus est, et fasciculum hunc
<lb/>ad Te perferendi officium ultra suscepit. Benevolo itaque animo
<lb/><rs type="biblio">Historiam Urani<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> cum Lite Astronomorum de Nomine, et H<subst><del><gap/></del><add>i</add></subst>ero<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>glypho</rs> acceptandam, et inter amicos distribuendam oro; gratum
<lb/>erit intelligere, quis Tibi <abbr>Ill<supplied>.</supplied><hi rend="sup u">me</hi></abbr> Domine de his sensus sit?
<lb/>gratum etiam erit, si celeberrimo Domino <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-116215372">Bode</rs> exemplum
<lb/>obtuleris cum salute <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me plurima, quem rogo edocendum, ne
<lb/>mentem meam de Nomine, et Hieroglypho novi hujus Planet<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
<lb/>versibus expressam animo minus amico interpretari velit, qui
<lb/>ultra profiteor, non <hi rend="u">esse meum motus Vocum componere Lites</hi>,
  <lb/>sed, <hi rend="u">sit Vota Austriadum Candida nosse, satis</hi>. Parum enim
<lb/>interest, quo Nomine et signo Planetam novum appellemus, modo
<lb/>elementa ejus per observationes exacta definire conemur. Vale
<lb/>et me Tui studiosissimum porro inter Tuos censere perge.
</p>

<closer><dateline><lb/><choice><orig>dabam</orig><reg>Dabam</reg></choice> <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2761369">Vienn<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <date when="1787-08-11">11 Augusti 1787</date>
</dateline><salute><lb/>devinctissimus
</salute><signed><lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119502208">Maximilianus Hell</rs>.</signed></closer>
